# play logs/alpine323 ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Logs screen proposed for slice 1,$
# inferred from v0.3.2 and origin/main, read from a simulated$
# host by the gallery's stand-ins, unit (b)'s to build. It only$
# reads: no plan, no y/N, no journal. No pager runs: an item$
# says what it would run. Nothing on this machine changes: every$
# command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: logs/alpine323$
# web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23, whose less is a link to$
# BusyBox (vm-runs/s1/01-tools.log). LESSSECURE=1 changes$
# nothing there: s still prompts Log file, E and :e Examine (vm-$
# runs/s1/04-less2-alpine323-vm.log). That its s writes and its$
# E opens any path as root is read (miscutils/less.c): no path$
# was typed. So treatment pager-less gives it no Open item$
# (decision 7). With Alpine's less package there is one (pager-$
# commands).$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
# File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Size                 601 bytes$
$
# Last 4 of 10 lines -------------------------------------------$
$
      2026/10/20 12:00:04 WARNING: hardn's boot unit was not$
      | removed: exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      | exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 INFO: Using configuration from:$
      | /etc/hardn/hardn.yml$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 SUCCESS: debian trixie detected$
$
  Select an option$
$
